What is the output of the following Java program?

String s1 = "Java";
String s2 = "Ja" + "va";
String s3 = new String("Java");
System.out.println((s1 == s2) + " " + (s1 == s3));

What will the following Java code print?

Integer a = 127;
Integer b = 127;
Integer c = 128;
Integer d = 128;
System.out.println((a == b) + " " + (c == d));
